{"id":52345,"ord":133,"n_segments":181,"prev":52344,"next":52346,"doc":{"id":"67256","title":"67256_Paul L. Howard oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Paul L. Howard","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/67256/","url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=67256"},"chapter":"Bands and jobs of the 1920s-50s","title":"Trying to recall the drummer at Virginia's","category":"band_or_employer","summary":"He cannot recall the drummer, and eliminates Bert Brooks and Alton Redd.","period":"1940s","year_from":1940,"year_to":1949,"words":139,"start":[232,9],"end":[233,12],"url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=67256#s52345","tags":{"places":[],"venues":[],"bands":[]},"people":[{"name":"Bert Brooks","qid":null,"n":3},{"name":"Alton Redd","qid":"Q30100220","n":2},{"name":"Arthur Twine","qid":null,"n":2},{"name":"Minor Hall","qid":"Q1555744","n":1}],"story":{"theme":14,"theme_name":"Drummers and drumming: who played what, and how","community":42,"community_name":"Great drummers: who they admired and why","core":true},"blocks":[{"p":232,"b":9,"s":"MR. HOWARD","x":"Arthur Twine played with me."},{"p":232,"b":10,"s":"MR. COLLETTE","x":"Right."},{"p":232,"b":11,"s":"MR. HOWARD","x":"Do you remember him?"},{"p":232,"b":12,"s":"MR. COLLETTE","x":"Yeah, I do remember him."},{"p":232,"b":13,"s":"MR. HOWARD","x":"And let's see --"},{"p":232,"b":14,"s":"MR. COLLETTE","x":"If you could think of the drummer. Well, it'll come to us later."},{"p":232,"b":15,"s":"MR. HOWARD","x":"It'll come to me."},{"p":233,"b":0,"s":"MR. COLLETTE","x":"It wasn't Brooks, was it, Bert Brooks?"},{"p":233,"b":1,"s":"MR. HOWARD","x":"Bert Brooks? No, no."},{"p":233,"b":2,"s":"MR. COLLETTE","x":"He didn't work with you?"},{"p":233,"b":3,"s":"MR. HOWARD","x":"Bert Brooks --"},{"p":233,"b":4,"s":"MR. COLLETTE","x":"It wasn't Alton Redd"},{"p":233,"b":5,"s":"MR. HOWARD","x":"No, it wasn't Alton."},{"p":233,"b":6,"s":"MR. COLLETTE","x":"What about -- wasn't Minor Hall a drummer?"},{"p":233,"b":7,"s":"MR. HOWARD","x":"Yeah. Let me tell you something about the drummer. The drummer that I had, he couldn't shuffle a drum around there. To play drums he had to play."},{"p":233,"b":8,"s":"MR. COLLETTE","x":"I see. But you had a good drummer."},{"p":233,"b":9,"s":"MR. HOWARD","x":"Yeah, but I'm trying to think who the drummer was. Arthur Twine. Arthur Twine. What did he play?"},{"p":233,"b":10,"s":"MR. COLLETTE","x":"Piano player."},{"p":233,"b":11,"s":"MR. HOWARD","x":"Piano player. Yeah, he played piano."},{"p":233,"b":12,"s":"MR. COLLETTE","x":"Yeah, well, we'll think about it."}]}